# mihomo always-on proxy (dedicated VPS subscription)

Local-only mixed proxy on 127.0.0.1:7890. Uses a subscription reserved for
this VPS and stays running at boot, so the Discord ingest bot can stay
connected and GitHub / extension installs can use the same proxy.

This is separate from the phone/computer subscription (3-device limit).

Commands (run as root):

  proxyctl on       start mihomo (and the Discord bot) if they are down
  proxyctl off      stop mihomo AND the Discord bot (bot will go offline)
  proxyctl status   show proxy and bot state

  withproxy <cmd>   run one command through the proxy; starts mihomo if
                    needed and leaves it running

git is configured to use http://127.0.0.1:7890 for https://github.com/.

Weekly subscription refresh (mihomo-refresh.timer) fetches direct first,
falls back to the local proxy, validates with `mihomo -t`, then restarts
mihomo and leaves it running.

The 2-hour idle auto-stop is no longer used.
